  "review_fixes": [
    "Capture and scrub the capability before Inertia starts; handle same-page saved links and Back/Forward without persisting the secret.",
    "Make both ticket read endpoints stateless so the compatibility path cannot enter Laravel's previous-URL session state; sanitize application errors and do-not-flash private values.",
    "Prevent rescheduling from reviving effectively expired or revoked links, even when a legacy stored expiry is longer.",
    "Keep recovery retries immutable when a refresh changes the version or removes the booking row.",
    "Use Yemen-local date boundaries when selecting sessions in the recovery booking list.",
    "Read the real unhydrated Inertia 3 shell in browser checks; update the P06 receipt assertion to preserve replay and one-audit checks after removing the public booking UUID.",
    "Bound browser diagnostic waits; compare generic error DTOs through actual HTTP requests while retaining browser response-status and unavailable-state assertions.",
    "Redact private-link text using screenshot-only CSS across P06 through P09 harnesses, preserving DOM values, layout, copy and download behavior."
  ],
